Modification
------------

  Modified by: Yuki Kokubun (Kuniwak)
  Date:        March 2026 (initial translation; the work is ongoing, see the
               Git history of this repository for the date of each change)
  Repository:  https://github.com/cc-kuniwak/lean-csp-prover

  Nature of the modification:

    The Isabelle/HOL theories of CSP-Prover (directories CSP, CSP_T, CSP_F,
    FNF_F, DFP and the example directories ep2, DM, Test, SA_Kung, NBuff,
    UCD) have been translated into the Lean 4 language, on top of Mathlib.
    Each Isabelle theory file X.thy corresponds to a Lean file
    LeanCspProver/<dir>/X.lean.

    The translation preserves the statements of the original definitions,
    lemmas and theorems as far as the two logics allow; proofs have been
    rewritten in Lean's tactic language. Isabelle-specific machinery
    (heap files, ROOT files, Isabelle proof methods, X-symbol declarations)
    has been replaced with Lean/Lake equivalents, and some auxiliary
    definitions and lemmas have been added where Isabelle's libraries and
    Mathlib differ.

    In addition, the following files are new and are not derived from
    CSP-Prover: lakefile.toml, lean-toolchain, lake-manifest.json,
    LeanCspProver.lean, LeanCspProver/Basic.lean,
    LeanCspProver/CSP/Compat.lean, scripts/, .github/, AGENTS.md, README.md
    and this NOTICE file.

